### GMOB API - Visitas (Agendamento)

### Variáveis
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 1. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### 2. Criar Visita
# @name createVisita
POST {{baseUrl}}/visitas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "imovel_id": 1,
  "cliente_id": 1,
  "data_visita": "2026-08-15",
  "hora_inicio": "10:00",
  "hora_termino": "11:00",
  "observacoes": "Visita para cliente interessado em apartamento com 2 quartos."
}

### 3. Listar Visitas (paginação padrão)
# @name listVisitasDefault
GET {{baseUrl}}/visitas?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Listar Visitas (filtro por imóvel)
# @name listVisitasByImovel
GET {{baseUrl}}/visitas?imovelId=1&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Listar Visitas (filtro por cliente e data)
# @name listVisitasByClientAndDate
GET {{baseUrl}}/visitas?clienteId=1&data=2026-08-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Buscar Visita por ID
# @name getVisitaById
GET {{baseUrl}}/visitas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Atualizar Visita (cancelar)
# @name cancelVisita
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/visitas/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status_agendamento": "cancelado"
}

### 8. Remover Visita
# @name deleteVisita
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/visitas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
